              "text": "### Factual Summary\n\n**Basic Tier Session (Stream ID: 3)**\n*   **Funding:** A basic stream was successfully initiated with a deposit of **10,000 raw units (0.01 USDC)**. The funds were escrowed via transaction `0x90436efa...`.\n*   **Operation:** The session demonstrated local CRE `OPEN` status and `CONTINUE` health checks. It processed **10 successful requests** across two batches (5 requests each) without individual payment transactions, proving stream reuse.\n*   **Outage & Closure:** A demo outage was injected, triggering an automatic `CLOSE` checkpoint. The stream terminated early.\n*   **Settlement:**\n    *   **Earned:** **720 raw units** accrued to the recipient based on time elapsed.\n    *   **Refunded:** **9,280 raw units** were returned to the sender wallet.\n    *   **Final Transaction:** Settlement occurred via transaction `0xffdd5b3c...`, updating balances accordingly. No DON/onchain CRE authorization was present (`donAuthenticated: false`).\n\n**Premium Tier Attempt**\n*   **Request:** A premium session was requested for **200,000 raw units (0.2 USDC)**.\n*   **Result:** The request was **denied** immediately due to policy violation (`AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_POLICY`). The system enforces a strict cap of **100,000 raw units (0.1 USDC)**.\n*   **Impact:** No transaction was signed, and wallet balances/nonces remained unchanged.",
